Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.04,0:00:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time the rain no longer falls,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.34,0:00:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,and I see the sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.40,0:00:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I think back to when I was\Na child Who could only cry,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.18,0:00:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,blindly chasing after\Nhim I fell far behind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.28,0:00:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,my only thought One day I will be stronger
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.46,0:00:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Bridery and gratitude fading with the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.90,0:00:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,wind Am I stronger now than I was before?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.44,0:00:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Or as weak as back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.02,0:00:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know for sure, but until I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.76,0:01:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My voyage will not end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.24,0:01:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what's next!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.36,0:01:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm walking straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.84,0:01:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.96,0:01:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing that can stop us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.64,0:01:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Though time's all on our side,\NWe'll never let it pull us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.56,0:01:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And we may fall, But we'll\Nalways keep on standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.64,0:01:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.32,0:01:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll take what I hold dear away from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.82,0:01:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The voices inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.34,0:01:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Push me to keep surviving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.74,0:01:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go on, I'll get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.64,0:01:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what I gotta do!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.34,0:01:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The fiercest of all can pour upon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.24,0:01:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care why in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.16,0:01:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Would I turn back?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.72,0:01:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.26,0:01:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing that can stop us now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.98,0:02:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Though time's not on our side,\NWe'll never let it pull us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.92,0:02:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And we may fall, But we'll\Nalways keep on standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.96,0:02:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way anything Will take\Nwhat I hold dear away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.18,0:02:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the future's there for us to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.16,0:02:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your way to the scaffold!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.02,0:02:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch your backs!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.92,0:02:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The giant unit's moving out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.66,0:02:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They're trying to head off Oars Jr!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.44,0:02:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to live up to our duty!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.82,0:02:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't defeat us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.56,0:02:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing is impossibly huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.72,0:02:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He's at least twice as\Nbig as a common giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.78,0:02:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep shooting!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.98,0:02:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a living creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.56,0:03:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Bullets should stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.38,0:03:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't say we were expecting\Nsuch a powerful beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.16,0:03:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.42,0:03:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fill up with land!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.72,0:03:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ors, don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.62,0:03:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're an easy target for them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.30,0:03:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Please turn around!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.18,0:03:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.36,0:03:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.66,0:03:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.16,0:03:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill that beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.70,0:04:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Boys, open up a path for\Nus to get into the bay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.96,0:04:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the bay and then the plaza!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.64,0:04:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it all! Fall back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.60,0:04:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Tighten up the defensive line and\Ndon't let them get to the plaza!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.06,0:04:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand down or die, Navy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.92,0:04:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.36,0:04:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.40,0:04:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We're at war here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.88,0:04:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have any use for the weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.40,0:05:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never had to crane my\Nhead up to look at anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.40,0:05:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.76,0:05:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That oars is just as\Nstubborn as he ever was.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.88,0:05:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting yourself killed\Ndoes not make you brave!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.96,0:05:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop me, Pops!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.70,0:05:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.00,0:05:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I don't wanna!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.72,0:05:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Not until I'm done!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.30,0:05:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Not until Serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.74,0:05:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna save my bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.52,0:05:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to do it now so it\Ndoesn't hurt. Go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.86,0:05:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.28,0:05:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, men.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.68,0:06:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Help out the big guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.98,0:06:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Go cover oars. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.04,0:06:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Howie was supposed to fight that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.20,0:06:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's too big.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.64,0:06:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Vice Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.36,0:06:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll avenge you. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.38,0:06:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Horse is one hell of a destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.72,0:06:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make our move!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.68,0:06:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Slave Arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.06,0:07:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.26,0:07:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They're statues!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.56,0:07:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you're the pirate empress, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.56,0:07:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.56,0:07:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm crumbling!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.42,0:07:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Curfew! Deer!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.70,0:07:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You psycho!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.30,0:07:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you attacking the Marines?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.48,0:07:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I may have agreed to aid you in your\Nfight against Whitebeard's crew,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.70,0:07:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,but I don't recall making any\Npromises about collateral damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.52,0:07:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Allies or foes, all men\Nare equally worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.34,0:07:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, except for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.64,0:07:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You can hate me if you want, but you\Ncan't say that I didn't keep my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.62,0:07:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.40,0:07:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't you at least take\Nmercy on my beauty?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.26,0:08:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.86,0:08:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.14,0:08:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna save you now, Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.60,0:08:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.86,0:08:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,One, one, one, one, one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.02,0:09:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself for the Ursa Shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.04,0:09:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.92,0:09:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oars, that's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.98,0:09:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You made this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.06,0:10:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, some folks I met in the\NWano Kingdom taught me how.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.08,0:10:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Try it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.50,0:10:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace ruined two others before\Nhe got that one right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.12,0:10:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They burned to a crisp.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.66,0:10:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what happens when someone\Nwho's made a fire weaves straw.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.98,0:10:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, a slice of coal under here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.26,0:10:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.34,0:10:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I like the look.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.50,0:10:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,AIM AND FIRE!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.12,0:10:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,OARS!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.38,0:10:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.32,0:10:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're an easy target now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.14,0:11:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Captain Oars, what are\Nyou doing outside in the rain?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.44,0:11:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Rain or shine, I'm doing fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.72,0:11:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get wet anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.42,0:11:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, I love this hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.72,0:11:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't save you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.12,0:11:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,at least I can take out\None of the warlords!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.42,0:11:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.04,0:11:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace is right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.94,0:11:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, my foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.58,0:11:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.82,0:11:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain! Hey, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.80,0:11:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to stay outside again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.02,0:11:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should I care?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.60,0:11:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The snow's not getting on my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.46,0:11:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,In the heat or the cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.32,0:12:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This head never gets old.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.30,0:12:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the best, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.72,0:12:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.74,0:12:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.04,0:12:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, he's still moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.74,0:12:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought he was...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.40,0:12:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He's infiltrated the plaza!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.96,0:13:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta go a little bit more!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.88,0:13:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.38,0:13:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can make it for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.40,0:13:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That damn Doe Flamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.98,0:13:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He knew I wanted ores intact!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.22,0:13:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't cut the foot off\Na corpse that once claimed!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.62,0:13:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Doppelman!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.26,0:13:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.58,0:13:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Spocky Shadow Lizard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.34,0:13:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.06,0:13:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,See, now that's how you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.34,0:13:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That is some good murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.88,0:13:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Captain Ors!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.64,0:14:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you, you warlord scumbag! Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.16,0:14:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ors, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.12,0:14:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Arse!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.74,0:14:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to fix up that foot of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.82,0:14:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's a small price to\Npay for another giant zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.46,0:14:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.52,0:15:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, oars.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.64,0:15:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't drop your guard, Whitebeard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.68,0:15:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Bicep Hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.58,0:15:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.42,0:15:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.16,0:15:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody just leave\NWhitebeard alone, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.96,0:15:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now climb up war's body and charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.56,0:16:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This is beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.24,0:16:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,To Flamingo,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.68,0:16:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,you're going to pay for what you did to\NBoris, and I'm going to collect the debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.72,0:16:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you laughing at?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.42,0:16:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you not laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.12,0:16:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We're standing on the\Nfulcrum of history itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.42,0:16:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The future and past will be written here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.88,0:16:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Put your hammer in the dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.40,0:16:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him down, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.24,0:16:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop dancing around and fight for real!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.90,0:17:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.72,0:17:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared and I'm weak and I'm useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.18,0:17:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Even our leaders are\Nfalling one after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.70,0:17:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way a loser like me\Nis going to survive out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.90,0:17:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.86,0:17:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm running away too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.38,0:17:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back to the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.88,0:17:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.88,0:17:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.04,0:17:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What's Admiral Akainu doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.34,0:17:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't die like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.90,0:17:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm terrified to leave\Nmy family on their own!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.78,0:18:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.69,0:18:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you, Admiral!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.64,0:18:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.72,0:18:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,As soldiers of the Navy,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.00,0:18:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,we carry the weight of the\Njustice of the world on our backs,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.00,0:18:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and will gladly die to defend it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.36,0:18:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Any man who turns tail and runs doesn't\Ndeserve to call himself a marine,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.78,0:18:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,let alone a man for that matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.88,0:18:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The most he could be\Ncalled is a waste of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.30,0:18:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If you truly care about your family as\Nyou say, you'll only shame them by living.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.10,0:18:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.14,0:18:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He killed one of his own soldiers?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.62,0:18:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Admiral Sakazuki, we're ready\Nto proceed with the operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.88,0:18:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.26,0:18:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's finally time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.94,0:18:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The operation?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.84,0:19:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Haze!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.88,0:19:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand, Commander. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.76,0:19:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got control of my body!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.56,0:19:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Delphamiga, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.36,0:19:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Please, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.02,0:19:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirates are evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.40,0:19:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy is just.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.80,0:19:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's only true\Nbecause history tells us so.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.18,0:19:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Children who've never\Nknown peace have different
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.38,0:19:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,values than children\Nwho've never known war.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.18,0:19:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who wins will rewrite the\Ndefinition of right and wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.06,0:19:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll decide the future\Nand how the past is written.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.36,0:19:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Will justice prevail?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.46,0:19:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, there's no other way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.90,0:19:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner will define\Nthe meaning of justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.50,0:19:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.41,0:19:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone get to the space oars bay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.36,0:20:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The bay is out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.96,0:20:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,A knife cutter?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.00,0:20:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the ice witch, Wado Bay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.76,0:20:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I've cut plenty of\Nglaciers tougher than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.70,0:20:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's move!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.10,0:20:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The path is open! Right\Nbehind you! All clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.86,0:20:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to move into the bay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.48,0:20:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They've broken through the bay\Nhead at two different points, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.46,0:20:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing left to prevent Whitebeard's\Nallies from entirely flooding the area!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.60,0:20:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid we've got no\Nway to hold them back, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.82,0:20:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.08,0:20:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.04,0:20:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.12,0:20:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Put the plan into action.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.74,0:20:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.32,0:20:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.80,0:20:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Either stand down or die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.82,0:20:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it, you old bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.74,0:20:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wash!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.42,0:20:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't put out the dry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.72,0:20:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel so fresh and clean!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.74,0:20:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, boys, maybe try again\Nin a couple hundred years.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.42,0:21:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Put a call out to all ships and soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.16,0:21:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, he's got a plan up his sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.86,0:21:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You've always been\Nresourceful, Buddha Sengoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.70,0:21:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.78,0:21:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.64,0:21:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Not having second thoughts, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.84,0:21:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No, they chose to be pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.96,0:21:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They brought this upon themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.58,0:21:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case... Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.20,0:21:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.06,0:21:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to sit here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.58,0:21:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Little idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.16,0:21:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Morons!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.07,0:22:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want either of\Nyou becoming pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.38,0:22:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't hit Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.90,0:22:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Mean old fart! Oh, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.46,0:22:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace, you come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.02,0:22:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no sympathy in me for criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.96,0:22:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But family is a different story.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.62,0:22:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.00,0:22:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.10,0:22:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace, you fool. Why couldn't you have just\Nlistened to me and done what I asked?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.20,0:22:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace, trust me on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.64,0:22:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You two really should join the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.38,0:22:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.46,0:22:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you'll make a strong Navy soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.36,0:23:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're feeling any doubt\Nover what must be done,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.42,0:23:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I just can't\Ntake pity on you, Garp.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.16,0:23:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had doubts, I would\Nhave done something already.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.94,0:23:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear what I just heard, Helmepo?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.10,0:23:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What their strategy is?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.10,0:23:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.01,0:23:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,They're going to bypass the schedule\Nand immediately execute Firefist Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.78,0:23:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But if they do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.78,0:23:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.69,0:23:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.78,0:23:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.69,0:23:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.61,0:23:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's falling from the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.62,0:23:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be another surprise\Nambush from Whitebeard!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.38,0:24:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You just have to overdo it every time!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.70,0:24:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is because of his death wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.66,0:24:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so it's all my fault?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.42,0:24:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares whose fault it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.68,0:24:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.68,0:24:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all frozen down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.50,0:24:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, I'm rubber. I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.10,0:24:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what about us, you selfish jerk?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.76,0:24:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Do something already.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.98,0:24:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not how I picture myself dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.32,0:24:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody help me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.26,0:24:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I still care about whose fault this\Nis, and it's all yours, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.28,0:24:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.00,0:24:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.82,0:24:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
